  "description": "Reusable Google OpenID Connect authentication for ASP.NET Core and Azure Functions hosts.\n      Owns the authorization-code/PKCE flow, purpose-bound HMAC tickets, cookie-based web sessions,\n      short-lived mobile access tokens, single-use grants, refresh rotation and CSRF enforcement.\n      Persistence is supplied by the host through IIdentityStore.",
